    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at the claim for the totaled Range Rover (Claim #88291-X). The claimant is being pretty aggressive and threatening a lawsuit if we don't settle this week. Can you give me your recommendation on how to handle the payout? I'm mostly looking to avoid any litigation or long legal headaches if we can help it.",
